3:T1a88,{"@context":"https://schema.org","@graph":[{"@type":"WebPage","@id":"https://chatwizs.com/blog/iphone-18-launch-date-price-features","url":"https://chatwizs.com/blog/iphone-18-launch-date-price-features","name":"iPhone 18 Leaks: Expected Launch Date, Features, Price & Design","description":"iPhone 18 launch date, expected price in India, A20 chip, new design leaks, and comparison of iPhone 18, Pro, and Pro Max. Full details inside.","inLanguage":"en-IN","isPartOf":{"@id":"https://chatwizs.com/#website"},"primaryImageOfPage":{"@id":"https://chatwizs.com/blog/iphone-18-launch-date-price-features#primaryimage"},"breadcrumb":{"@id":"https://chatwizs.com/blog/iphone-18-launch-date-price-features#breadcrumb"},"datePublished":"2026-05-26","dateModified":"2026-05-26","speakable":{"@type":"SpeakableSpecification","cssSelector":["h1","#ai-snapshot",".post-content p:first-of-type"]},"audience":{"@type":"Audience","audienceType":"Digital Marketing Professionals, SEO Experts","geographicArea":{"@type":"Country","name":"India"}},"potentialAction":{"@type":"ReadAction","target":"https://chatwizs.com/blog/iphone-18-launch-date-price-features"}},{"@type":"BlogPosting","@id":"https://chatwizs.com/blog/iphone-18-launch-date-price-features#article","headline":"iPhone 18 Leaks: Expected Launch Date, Features, Price & Design","name":"iPhone 18 Leaks: Expected Launch Date, Features, Price & Design","description":"iPhone 18 launch date, expected price in India, A20 chip, new design leaks, and comparison of iPhone 18, Pro, and Pro Max. Full details inside.","datePublished":"2026-05-26","dateModified":"2026-05-26","author":{"@type":"Person","@id":"https://chatwizs.com/#person/kapil-kumar","name":"Kapil Kumar","url":"https://chatwizs.com/author/kapil-kumar","image":"/uploads/media-1779256004256-409405479.jpeg","jobTitle":"Car Review / Automobile Review / Vehicle Analysis","description":"","sameAs":["https://www.linkedin.com/in/prasantbagriya/","https://prashantbagriya.graphy.com/"]},"publisher":{"@id":"https://chatwizs.com/#organization"},"image":["/uploads/media-1779794143548-72338622.png","/uploads/media-1779794143548-72338622.png?ar=1x1","/uploads/media-1779794143548-72338622.png?ar=4x3","/uploads/media-1779794143548-72338622.png?ar=16x9"],"mainEntityOfPage":{"@id":"https://chatwizs.com/blog/iphone-18-launch-date-price-features"},"articleBody":"Breaking news for all the iPhone lovers, Apple is all set to launch the much-awaited iPhone 18 with exciting new features, a powerful processor, and a stylish new design. According to early leaks and reports, the upcoming iPhone could bring major upgrades in AI technology, camera quality, battery life, and performance. Apple fans across the world are already excited to see what the tech giant has planned for its next-generation smartphone.I Phone 18 Launch DateApple is expected to launch the new iPhone 18 in June 2026, and fans are already waiting excitedly for the official announcement. While the company has not confirmed the exact date yet, several reports suggest that Apple may introduce the smartphone with advanced AI features, improved cameras, and a more powerful performance. The launch event is likely to attract huge attention from tech lovers around the world.Apple IPhone 18 PriceThe expected price of the iPhone 18 in India could be around ₹1,34,900 for the premium variant. According to early reports, Apple may slightly increase the pricing due to major AI upgrades, a powerful chipset, and a premium body design. In the global market, the iPhone 18 Pro is expected to start near $1,149 (around ₹1.06 lakh), while the Pro Max version could be priced at nearly $1,249 (around ₹1.15 lakh).iPhone 18 New Features &amp; Body DesignThe iPhone 18 is expected to come with a premium new look and smarter AI-powered features for a better user experience. Apple may also introduce a slimmer body design with improved display quality and stronger performance.iPhone 18 New Features &amp; Body DesignAdvanced AI-powered featuresNew slim and lightweight body designImproved camera quality with better zoomFaster A20 Bionic chipset performanceBigger battery backup and fast chargingNearly bezel-less display with smoother refresh rateStrong titanium frame for premium feelBetter Face ID and security featuresEnhanced gaming and multitasking experienceNew stylish color options expectediPhone 18 vs iPhone 18 Pro vs iPhone 18 Pro Max ComparisonThe standard iPhone 18 is expected to be perfect for regular users who want a stylish phone with smooth performance, a good camera, and strong battery life at a comparatively lower price. It may come with a compact design and smart AI features for daily use.The iPhone 18 Pro could offer a more premium experience with a titanium body, advanced camera system, and faster A20 Pro chipset. This model may be ideal for creators, multitaskers, and users who want extra power and professional-level features.Meanwhile, the iPhone 18 Pro Max is likely to become the most powerful model in the lineup. It may feature the biggest display, best battery backup, improved zoom camera, and top-level gaming performance. Apple could also introduce exclusive AI tools and premium upgrades in this high-end variant.While the iPhone 18 may focus on affordability and balanced performance, the Pro and Pro Max versions are expected to deliver a more luxurious and feature-packed experience for heavy users and tech lovers.Who Should Buy the iPhone 18 Series?The iPhone 18 series could be a great choice for users looking for premium design, powerful performance, and advanced AI features. The standard iPhone 18 may suit everyday users, while the Pro and Pro Max models could be perfect for gamers, content creators, photographers, and people who want the best Apple experience.","keywords":"iphone 18 launch-date price features","wordCount":535,"timeRequired":"PT3M","inLanguage":"en-IN","isAccessibleForFree":true,"isPartOf":{"@id":"https://chatwizs.com/#website"},"audience":{"@type":"Audience","geographicArea":{"@type":"Country","name":"India","sameAs":"https://www.wikidata.org/wiki/Q668"}},"reviewedBy":{"@type":"Person","name":"Prasant Bagriya","jobTitle":"Editorial Reviewer"},"about":[{"@type":"Thing","name":"Tech"}],"mentions":[{"@type":"Thing","name":"iphone 18 launch-date price features"}]},{"@type":"BreadcrumbList","@id":"https://chatwizs.com/blog/iphone-18-launch-date-price-features#breadcrumb","itemListElement":[{"@type":"ListItem","position":1,"name":"Home","item":"https://chatwizs.com/"},{"@type":"ListItem","position":2,"name":"Tech","item":"https://chatwizs.com/category/tech"},{"@type":"ListItem","position":3,"name":"iPhone 18 Leaks: Expected Launch Date, Features, Price & Design","item":"https://chatwizs.com/blog/iphone-18-launch-date-price-features"}]}]}0:{"rsc":["$","$1","c",{"children":[["$","article",null,{"itemScope":true,"itemType":"https://schema.org/BlogPosting","style":{"width":"100%","maxWidth":"1200px","margin":"0 auto"},"children":[["$","$L2",null,{}],["$","link",null,{"rel":"preload","as":"image","href":"/uploads/media-1779794143548-72338622.png","fetchPriority":"high","imageSizes":"(max-width: 1200px) 100vw, 1200px","imageSrcSet":"/uploads/media-1779794143548-72338622.png?w=640 640w, /uploads/media-1779794143548-72338622.png?w=1200 1200w"}],["$","script",null,{"type":"application/ld+json","dangerouslySetInnerHTML":{"__html":"$3"}}],"$L4","$L5","$undefined","$undefined","$undefined","$L6","$L7","$L8"]}],["$L9","$La"],"$Lb"]}],"isPartial":false,"staleTime":300,"varyParams":null,"buildId":"ZJ7srt7FqBd5WcgufR1xn"}
